        },
        {
            "id": 11699,
            "question_id": 23724,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: distribute — роздавати. Умова описує процес до минулого моменту, а не лише завершений результат. Збережи причину, протиставлення або часовий зв’язок, названі в умові.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11700,
            "question_id": 23724,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Describe distribution as a process interrupted by exhaustion of supplies.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11701,
            "question_id": 23724,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: distribute. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11702,
            "question_id": 23724,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "pl",
            "hint": "Użyj Past Perfect Continuous dla wcześniejszego procesu. Zacznij od podmiotu zdania głównego; nie przenoś wyrażeń czasu ani przyczyny na początek. Wolontariusze rozdawali koce, aż skończyły się zapasy.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11703,
